			"notes": "### What's new\n- **Sparkling Auto Share:** optionally sends every Sparkling straight to party chat\n- **Alert panels:** choose for each alert whether it goes to party chat, your screen, or both\n- **Separate panels:** Warp check and Biome announcements now have their own panels and stay centered\n- **HUD editor:** center guide lines with snapping and a position readout\n- **Mod Menu:** the settings button opens the `/sp` menu\n- **Capsule Helper:** toggle it right from the `/sp` menu card\n\n### Fixes\n- Snoozle walls now stay until the wall is broken, not when a Snoozle is caught\n\n### Notes\n- `/sp announce screen` was removed; use the `/sp` menu instead\n- If you had moved the Sparkling panel, it goes back to its default spot once\n\n| Minecraft | File |\n|---|---|\n| 26.3 | `safari-patron-1.0.1+26.3.jar` |\n| 26.2 | `safari-patron-1.0.1+26.2.jar` |"
